          "kind": "plate",
          "plate": "goldprice",
          "hold": 45.3,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "One pilgrim's gold crashed a market",
              "sub": "Cairo's gold price sank for years",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 6.06
            },
            {
              "text": "Cairo, Egypt, the year 1324",
              "sub": "the king of Mali, Mansa Musa, arrives",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 6.4,
              "until": 12.19
            },
            {
              "text": "His caravan is crossing to Makkah",
              "sub": "and giving gold away the whole way",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 12.53,
              "until": 18.57
            },
            {
              "text": "So much that the price of gold sags",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 18.91,
              "until": 22.5
            },
            {
              "text": "It takes years to climb back",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 22.84,
              "until": 25.87
            },
            {
              "text": "But the gold is not the story",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 26.21,
              "until": 29.35
            },
            {
              "text": "He returns home with scholars and jurists",
              "sub": "and an architect from Spain",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 29.69,
              "until": 35.75
            },
            {
              "text": "He builds Timbuktu into a city of books",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 36.09,
              "until": 39.95
            },
            {
              "eyebrow": "Mansa Musa, Mali",
              "text": "The gold settled back into vaults",
              "src": "Cairo chronicles; the Catalan Atlas, 1375",
              "size": "h1",
